sequenceDiagram
    actor Customer as PER-001 (Customer)
    participant Channel as SVC-017<br/>Digital Channels
    participant Retail as SVC-001<br/>Retail Banking Core
    participant IAM as SVC-100<br/>IAM
    participant EventBus as SVC-102<br/>Event Bus
    participant Risk as SVC-012<br/>Risk Engine
    participant KYC as SVC-014<br/>KYC/AML
    participant DomPay as SVC-009<br/>Domestic Payments
    participant Compliance as SVC-015<br/>Compliance Core
    participant Notifications as SVC-053<br/>Notifications
    participant Audit as SVC-103<br/>Audit & Logging

    Note over Customer,Audit: PH-111 — Loan Application Submission

    Customer->>Channel: Select £10,000 / 36 months / home improvement
    Channel->>Retail: GET /loans/eligibility?amount=10000&term_months=36 (soft check)
    Retail-->>Channel: {eligible: true, indicative_apr: "5.9-12.9%"}
    Channel-->>Customer: Display SECCI form + indicative APR range
    Customer->>Channel: Complete income/expenditure + SCA
    Channel->>IAM: POST /sca/validate {assertion}
    IAM-->>Channel: {valid: true}
    Channel->>Retail: POST /loans/applications {loan_amount: 10000, income: 3500, expenditure: 1200, secci_acknowledged: true}
    Note right of Retail: Create LoanApplication (status=submitted)
    Retail-->>Channel: 202 Accepted {application_id, poll_url}
    Retail->>EventBus: Publish LoanApplicationSubmitted (EVT-152)

    Note over Customer,Audit: PH-112 — Creditworthiness and Affordability Assessment

    EventBus->>Risk: Consume EVT-152 → Hard credit bureau search + DTI + stress test
    EventBus->>KYC: Consume EVT-152 → AML monitoring setup
    Risk->>EventBus: Publish CreditAssessmentCompleted (EVT-153) {approved, risk_band: B, apr: 6.9%, repayment: 308.22}
    EventBus->>Retail: Consume EVT-153 → Update LoanApplication status=approved; create LoanOffer
    Channel->>Retail: GET /loans/applications/{id} (customer polling)
    Retail-->>Channel: {status: offer_presented, offer: {apr: 6.9%, monthly_repayment: 308.22, total_repayable: 11095.92}}
    Channel-->>Customer: Display offer: APR 6.9%, £308.22/month, £11,095.92 total, 14-day withdrawal right

    Note over Customer,Audit: PH-113 — Loan Offer and Agreement Execution

    Customer->>Channel: Accept agreement + complete SCA to sign electronically
    Channel->>IAM: POST /sca/validate {assertion}
    IAM-->>Channel: {valid: true}
    Channel->>Retail: POST /loans/applications/{id}/accept {agreement_accepted: true, sca_assertion_ref, nominated_account_id}
    Note right of Retail: Create LoanAgreement (status=executed)<br/>Create LoanAccount (status=pending_disbursement)
    Retail->>EventBus: Publish LoanAgreementExecuted (EVT-154)
    EventBus->>Compliance: Consume EVT-154 → Record consumer credit agreement (CONC reporting)
    EventBus->>Audit: Consume EVT-154 → Write immutable agreement execution record

    Note over Customer,Audit: PH-114 — Loan Drawdown and Account Activation

    EventBus->>DomPay: Consume EVT-154 → Execute drawdown transfer £10,000 to nominated account
    Note right of Retail: Update LoanAccount: status=active, outstanding_balance=10000
    Retail->>EventBus: Publish LoanDrawdownCompleted (EVT-155)
    EventBus->>Notifications: Consume EVT-155 → Dispatch disbursement confirmation
    EventBus->>Audit: Consume EVT-155 → Write drawdown audit record
